It is derived from the data deposit accompanying:

  Hardwick RM, Forrence AD, Krakauer JW, Haith AM (2019). Time-dependent
  competition between goal-directed and habitual response preparation.
  Nature Human Behaviour, 3, 1252-1262. doi:10.1038/s41562-019-0725-0

  Deposit: Hardwick RM, Haith AM (2019). "Time-Dependent Competition Between
  Goal-Directed and Habitual Response Selection." https://osf.io/3fjez/

The deposit is released under the MIT License, reproduced below from its own
LICENCE.txt. data-raw/habit_prep.R rebuilds the object from the deposit and
records exactly which parts of it are used.

